sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Khách hàng
    participant FE as business-store-frontend
    participant C as OrderController
    participant O as OrderServiceImpl
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant P as PromotionServiceImpl
    participant PB as PhotobookProjectServiceImpl
    participant L as NotificationEventListener
    participant R as Redis pub/sub
    U->>FE: Xác nhận checkout
    FE->>C: POST /api/v1/orders/checkout (JSON/HTTPS, Bearer JWT)
    C->>O: checkout(userId, CheckoutOrderRequest)
    O->>DB: Đọc Cart, địa chỉ, Product/Variant và khóa tồn kho (JPA/JDBC)
    DB-->>O: Dữ liệu và tồn kho hợp lệ
    O->>DB: Ghi Order/OrderItem, giảm stock, xóa Cart (transaction)
    opt Có couponCode
        O->>P: reserve(userId, order, couponCode)
        P->>DB: Ghi reservation giảm giá (JPA/JDBC)
    end
    opt Có OrderItem photobook
        O->>PB: openProjectsFor(order)
        PB->>DB: Ghi PhotobookProject (JPA/JDBC)
    end
    O-->>C: OrderResponse
    Note over O,L: Sau khi transaction commit
    O->>L: OrderPlacedEvent (Spring event)
    L->>R: Publish thông báo đơn mới (Redis pub/sub)
    C-->>FE: 201 Created + OrderResponse
